---
const principles = [
  ['Curiosity','Ask better questions before reaching for familiar answers.'],
  ['Ownership','Stay close to the details and take responsibility for the outcome.'],
  ['Execution','Turn sound thinking into work that can be tested in the real world.'],
];
---
<div class="co-sub co-team">
  <section class="co-sub-hero"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-sub-hero-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE WORK</p><h1>Different minds.<br/><em>Shared ownership.</em></h1><p class="co-lead">A team built around curiosity, responsibility, and the willingness to do the work required to make meaningful progress.</p></div><div class="co-team-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="co-orbit co-orbit-a"></div><div class="co-orbit co-orbit-b"></div><div class="co-core">E<span>.</span></div><small>ONE SHARED DIRECTION</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section"><div class="co-sub-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">HOW WE WORK TOGETHER</p><div class="co-sub-heading"><h2>Good work needs<br/><em>more than good ideas.</em></h2><p>It takes people who can move between asking why, understanding what is happening, and making something better.</p></div><div class="co-principles">{principles.map((item,i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{item[0]}</h3><p>{item[1]}</p></div><b>↗</b></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-tint"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-story-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">OUR STORY, IN BRIEF</p><h2>Built because<br/><em>important problems deserve builders.</em></h2></div><div><p>E Deviser began with a conviction: understanding a difficult problem should lead somewhere. We wanted to build—not simply advise, observe, or wait for someone else to act.</p><p>That instinct still guides the company: get close to the problem, bring the right capabilities together, build, test, learn, and keep improving.</p><a href="/company/">Explore the company overview ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-story-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">OUR PHILOSOPHY</p><h2>Problem first.<br/><em>Progress through practice.</em></h2></div><div><p>We start with what needs solving—not with a fashionable technology or a predetermined answer. We value depth over assumptions, learning through building, outcomes over outputs, and curiosity that stays open to evidence.</p><p>These principles are not a separate doctrine. They are the standard we bring to the work and to one another.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-tint"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-people"><div><p class="co-kicker">THE PEOPLE</p><h2>People make<br/><em>the work possible.</em></h2><p>We bring together different perspectives and disciplines around problems worth solving. As the team grows, this page will introduce the people and the work they lead.</p></div><div class="co-people-note"><span>TEAM PROFILES</span><strong>Coming as roles and biographies are confirmed.</strong><small>We will only publish approved names, titles, and portraits.</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-end"><div class="co-sub-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">BUILD WITH US</p><h2>Bring your perspective.<br/><em>Make something matter.</em></h2><a class="co-pill" href="/company/careers-contact/">Careers &amp; contact ↗</a></div></section>
</div>
<style>
.co-sub{--sub-bg:#07121d;--sub-text:#f5f9fb;--sub-muted:#aabac5;--sub-line:#29404d;background:var(--sub-bg);color:var(--sub-text);overflow:hidden}.co-sub *{box-sizing:border-box}.co-sub-wrap{width:min(88rem,calc(100% - 3rem));margin:auto}.co-sub-section{padding:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,8rem) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-sub-tint{background:#0a1926}.co-kicker{margin:0 0 1.5rem;color:var(--brand-teal-light);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-xs);font-weight:var(--weight-bold);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-wide);text-transform:uppercase}.co-sub h1,.co-sub h2{margin:1rem 0 1.5rem;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5.5vw,5.6rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.06em}.co-sub h1 em,.co-sub h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#70c8d0}.co-sub p{color:var(--sub-muted);line-height:1.8}.co-sub-hero{padding:clamp(5rem,9vw,9rem) 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 45%,#0382bd25,transparent 40%)}.co-sub-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}.co-lead{max-width:39rem;font-size:1.08rem}.co-team-art{height:25rem;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--sub-line);background:radial-gradient(circle,#0382bd25,transparent 55%)}.co-core{width:7rem;height:7rem;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#0d2635;border:1px solid #5ab9b477;font:800 4rem var(--font-display);box-shadow:0 0 60px #0382bd30}.co-core span{color:#70c8d0}.co-orbit{position:absolute;width:72%;height:36%;border:1px solid #5ab9b455;border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(-28deg)}.co-orbit-b{transform:rotate(42deg);width:60%;height:58%;border-color:#70c8d044}.co-team-art small{position:absolute;bottom:1.5rem;font:500 .58rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.14em;color:#91cdd0}.co-sub-heading,.co-story-grid,.co-people{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}.co-sub-heading>p,.co-story-grid>div:last-child{max-width:38rem}.co-principles{margin-top:3rem;border-top:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-principles article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr 2rem;gap:1.2rem;align-items:center;padding:1.5rem .3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-principles article>span{font:600 .65rem var(--font-mono);color:#70c8d0}.co-principles h3{font-size:1.35rem;margin:0}.co-principles p{margin:.4rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem}.co-principles article>b{color:#70c8d0;font-weight:400}.co-story-grid h2,.co-people h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.4vw,4.6rem)}.co-story-grid a{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;color:#a5e1e0;text-decoration:none;font-weight:650;font-size:.85rem}.co-people-note{padding:2.5rem;border:1px solid var(--sub-line);background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 10%,#0382bd22,transparent 60%)}.co-people-note span,.co-people-note small{display:block;font:500 .6rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:#70c8d0}.co-people-note strong{display:block;margin:2rem 0;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.4}.co-people-note small{color:#8299a6;line-height:1.7}.co-sub-end{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 55%,#0382bd22,transparent 48%)}.co-pill{display:inline-flex;margin-top:1rem;padding:.85rem 1.3rem;border:1px solid #5ab9b4;border-radius:99px;color:#c7f0ed;text-decoration:none;font-size:.85rem}.co-sub-end h2{margin-bottom:2rem}
@media(max-width:760px){.co-sub-hero-grid,.co-sub-heading,.co-story-grid,.co-people{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.co-team-art{height:19rem}.co-sub-wrap{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.co-sub *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>